{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Online with up to 16 friends, taking on the role of either Chef or Butcher. Chefs win by completing orders flawlessly or uncovering the butchers and voting them out of the kitchen. Butchers aim to sabotage orders and turn innocent chefs into mincemeat. Keep things fresh with 4 unique maps and 2 different food types to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/Chef.png?t=1748912107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHEFS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Deliver orders to Customers or fire all Butchers to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Keep an eye on the Restaurant Rating to spot bad orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Report dead bodies to call the staff to a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Cast votes to fire suspected butchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/Butcher.png?t=1748912107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUTCHERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Murder Chefs and shift the blame to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Record fake Customer orders to confuse Chefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Deliver bad orders to lower the Restaurant Rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Start fires in the Pizza ovens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Trap Chefs in the freezer vault doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Mess with the freezer temperature to freeze Chefs or melt Ice Cream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hide important items like Buckets, Blenders, and Fire Extinguishers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Customizable chef with colors, hats, and followers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Expansive settings menu for customizable game rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 In-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Global lobby browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Shareable lobby code.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572120?t=1748912107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/d74e60c715386e87e91d104655593b814bf786a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748912107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/e3059b371cd734f0e8242dfa255420af2de7451b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748912107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/e3059b371cd734f0e8242dfa255420af2de7451b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748912107","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Online with up to 16 friends, taking on the role of either Chef or Butcher. Chefs win by completing orders flawlessly or uncovering the butchers and voting them out of the kitchen. Butchers aim to sabotage orders and turn innocent chefs into mincemeat. Keep things fresh with 4 unique maps and 2 different food types to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/Chef.png?t=1748912107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHEFS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Deliver orders to Customers or fire all Butchers to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Keep an eye on the Restaurant Rating to spot bad orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Report dead bodies to call the staff to a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Cast votes to fire suspected butchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/Butcher.png?t=1748912107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUTCHERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Murder Chefs and shift the blame to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Record fake Customer orders to confuse Chefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Deliver bad orders to lower the Restaurant Rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Start fires in the Pizza ovens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Trap Chefs in the freezer vault doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Mess with the freezer temperature to freeze Chefs or melt Ice Cream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hide important items like Buckets, Blenders, and Fire Extinguishers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Customizable chef with colors, hats, and followers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Expansive settings menu for customizable game rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 In-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Global lobby browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Shareable lobby code.</p>","developers":["Titania Lane, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/1537f663bb83c039583daf2a4d90022db5c74d8e/header.jpg?t=1748912107","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Titania Lane, Inc. All rights reserved. Titania Lane, the Titania Lane logo, Ghost Kitchen, and the Ghost Kitchen logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Titania Lane, Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</